<title>USA: May Department Stores issues $125 mln debt.</title>
<headline>May Department Stores issues $125 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from May Department Stores was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Morgan Stanley &amp; Co, Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER MAY DEPARTMENT STORES</p>
<p>AMT $125 MLN	  COUPON 6.875 PCT  MATURITY 11/1/05</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	    ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 5/1/96</p>
<p>LAST MOODY A2	 YIELD 6.875 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A   SPREAD 51 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
